      "title": "CONSTITUTION ET MODE D'ACTION DES VACCINS TUtS",
      "pageStart": 4,
      "pageEnd": 7,
      "target": "../sections/sec-004-constitution-et-mode-daction-des-vaccins-tuts.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "VACCINS TUES FIGURES\nL'injection d'un vaccin tue provoque l'apparition\ndans le serum de divers anticorps, mais la plupart\nd'entre eux n'ont aucun role dans la constitution de\nl'immunite protectrice.\nII est probable qu'un jour\nl'immunochimie permettra de reconnaitre et d'isoler\nles constituants des cellules microbiennes qui se\ncomportent en antigenes protecteurs. Actuellement,\nnos connaissances sont incompletes\net deconcer-\ntantes: ni la constitution chimique, ni la localisation\ndans la cellule bacterienne ne permettent de diff&\nrencier les antigenes protecteurs des autres. Ce qui\nest vrai pour",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Explains that most killed vaccines are suspensions of bacteria fixed by heat or antiseptics, which resist lysis and give irregular immunity. It reviews lysed vaccines prepared by chemical, physical or biological means and argues that protective antigens lie inside as well as on the surface of bacteria. Evidence from other bacteria such as Pasteurella septica is used to show that autolysis products carry protective power.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
