      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "CONCLUSIONS ET SUGGESTIONS",
      "pageStart": 8,
      "pageEnd": 9,
      "target": "../sections/sec-007-conclusions-et-suggestions.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "PREPARATION DES VACCINS\nL'intervention de la bacteriolyse clandestine per-\nmet d'expliquer pourquoi\n1'efficacite des vaccins\nanticholeriques est tres irreguliere. Elle explique le\npouvoir immunisant plus eleve des vaccins en milieu\nliquide (directs). L'utilisation judicieuse de la bact&\nriolyse controlee doit permettre la preparation de\nvaccins efficaces et stables.\n1.\nLes souches vaccinales doivent posseder, outre\nles autres proprietes enumerees dans les normes de\nl'OMS (1959), un pouvoir autolytique eleve.\n2.\nVaccins en milieu solide (type A). Preparer les\nsuspensions de V. cholerae directem",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Sets out conclusions on preparing cholera vaccines through controlled bacteriolysis using strains with high autolytic power, for both solid- and liquid-medium vaccines. It also lists ways to evaluate efficacy, through serology, nitrogen or antigen assays, and animal protection tests, and proposes an international programme of work.",
        "state": "draft",
